  "honest_scope": "A FUNCTIONAL recursive-mentalizing + pragmatics correlate. PART A: a bounded WM-buffer stack of agent-keyed belief frames predicts a 2nd-order false belief (frame_2), dissociable from reality AND from the 1st-order belief (frame_1) -- so a 1st-order reader FAILS -- and collapses under flatten-lesion / buffer-scramble / permuted-premises. PART B: the scalar implicature EMERGES at the depth-2 pragmatic listener (absent at the literal L0) from the substrate's iterated divisive normalization, and collapses when the normalization is lesioned or the lexicon permuted. The literal-truth lexicon is the legitimate linguistic input; the ToM/pragmatics-specific neural work is the gated frame stack and the iterated competitive normalization. The depth profile characterizes the bounded-recursion limit (deeper nesting = more chained writes; humans cap ~2-3). NOT a claim of phenomenal access to another mind. numpy-CPU on real spiking Izhikevich bridges; NO sim/ edit (reuse-by-import of W3 + the GNW machinery). Self-report is a functional read-out, never a phenomenal-experience claim."
